"Behind the Holly"
"This narrow path is littered with chunks of dead wood and charred rocks.  No
vegetation grows here, save for the pair of giant holly bushes to the north.
The hillside rises high above you to the west, while to the east the ground
drops off toward the valley floor.  Two large rocks block off the western
exit, though it looks possible to squeeze between them.  A small path runs off
to the south.
"
