"Cave End"
"The rough rock walls of the cave disappear into a deep veil of darkness. 
A slight echo and a rush of cool air suggest that the chamber is quite
large, even as you are unable to determine its actual dimensions.  An
almost stench of rotting flesh and urine penetrates your nostrils.  It
seems to emanate from a haphazard pile of rubble and matted straw to your
left.  Several huge boulders are stacked off in a dark corner.
"
