"Overgrown Ledge"
"A large ledge high in the hills, covered with thick weeds and brush.  The
vegetation here seems almost alive, moving slowly away from you, somehow
sensing where you will step and avoiding your footfalls.  On three sides,
rocky cliff walls rise up above you, with thousands of thorny bushes and vines
covering their craggy faces.  Below you to the east, you see a small goat path
cut across a steep hillside.
"
""
